    "can you at least tell me whether the minimum-hours rule (undergrads ≥ 8h, grads ≥ 7h) applies to all six students, or should I treat all six as having the same minimum (e.g., all ≥ 8h or all ≥ 7h) until the split is confirmed?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy decision regarding how to handle the minimum hours for the six students while the undergraduate/graduate split is pending."
